direction: right
title: Point-to-Point Task Queues vs Publish-Subscribe Topics

PTP: 1. Point-to-Point Queue (RabbitMQ) {
  style.fill: "#0B132B"
  style.stroke: "#0284C7"
  prod: Producer
  q: Work Queue
  w1: Worker Pod 1
  w2: Worker Pod 2
  prod -> q
  q -> w1: Consumed once
  q -> w2: Competing worker
}

PubSub: 2. Publish-Subscribe Topics (Kafka) {
  style.fill: "#06201B"
  style.stroke: "#10B981"
  prod: Producer
  topic: Event Topic
  sub1: Billing Service Group
  sub2: Notification Service Group
  prod -> topic
  topic -> sub1: Broadcast copy
  topic -> sub2: Broadcast copy
}
